    <briefdescription>
<para>benchmarking the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_finite_volume_stencil" kindref="compound">FiniteVolumeStencil</ref> container class underpinning CSMP&apos;s transport schemes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Compares the access speed of <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_finite_volume_stencil" kindref="compound">FiniteVolumeStencil</ref> with a refactored version based on <ref refid="class_dynamic_array2_d" kindref="compound">DynamicArray2D</ref> and <ref refid="class_dynamic_array3_d" kindref="compound">DynamicArray3D</ref></para>
<para><simplesect kind="attention"><para>a tetrahedral / triangular element mesh is used to to keep variable access cost to a mininum </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
